  "description": "Fast, low-allocation HTML5 parser and CSS selector engine for .NET 10/11 that builds a browser-like DOM from real-world markup: WHATWG tree construction with the adoption agency algorithm, tables, templates, inline SVG/MathML, the full entity table and encoding detection, plus fragment parsing (innerHTML). Compiled and cached selectors with an optional document index, a DOM-free pull parser, async streaming, HtmlLoader for URLs, optional node pooling, and zero third-party dependencies. Trim-safe and AOT-compatible.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "NkkinParser",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-16T10:57:45.44Z",
