  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 273617,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/Nkkinsoft/NkkinParser",
  "published": "2026-11-16T10:52:22.257Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.1.0: adds fragment parsing (HtmlParser.ParseFragment and an Element.InnerHtml setter, as innerHTML in browsers); fixes </template> leaving inner elements open, table parts inside templates, column groups, nested forms and selects, formatting end tags across tables, and legacy void elements (html5lib 93.6%, fragments 92%). No breaking changes from 3.0.0. 3.0.0: adds net11.0 next to net10.0; QuerySelectorAll returns ImmutableArray<Element> (breaking: use .Length). See https://github.com/Nkkinsoft/NkkinParser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md.",
